{"actor": "t16", "id": 44493, "payload": {"offer": {"created_tick": 871, "expires_tick": 881, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [{"id": 234, "kind": "card", "print_run": 300, "rarity": "common", "ref": "MAL-04", "serial": 8, "set": "MAL"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}, "id": 13327, "maker": "t16", "status": "open", "thread": null, "to": null, "venue": "rastro", "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 14, "types": []}}, "venue": "rastro"}, "scope": "public", "t": 8.5833, "tick": 871, "type": "offer.listed"}
{"actor": "chato", "id": 44494, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 8109, "offer": {"created_tick": 871, "expires_tick": 875, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:SAL-07"]}, "id": 13322, "maker": "chato", "status": "open", "thread": 1238, "to": "t13", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 30, "types": []}}, "sender": "chato", "team": "t13", "text": "Twenty-five. You moved one, I move one. Thirty. Sundays are nice. Coins are nicer.", "thread": 1238, "with": "chato"}, "scope": "public", "t": 8.5833, "tick": 871, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "abuela", "id": 44497, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 8110, "offer": {"created_tick": 871, "expires_tick": 875, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 5, "types": []}, "id": 13323, "maker": "abuela", "status": "open", "thread": 1240, "to": "t15", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [{"id": 218, "kind": "card", "print_run": 300, "rarity": "common", "ref": "SAL-04", "serial": 8, "set": "SAL"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}}, "sender": "abuela", "team": "t15", "text": "Ay, cariño, qué cabezón eres, igualito que mi nieto. Pero de repetidas tengo una caja hasta arriba. Mira, Café en Goya, 5 P, para ti. Y un consejo, hijo: una página completa vale mucho más que las cartas sueltas. ¡Cambia tus repetidas! ¿Ya has comido algo?", "thread": 1240, "with": "abuela"}, "scope": "public", "t": 8.5833, "tick": 871, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "t06", "id": 44500, "payload": {"offer": {"created_tick": 871, "expires_tick": 891, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [{"id": 76, "kind": "card", "print_run": 300, "rarity": "common", "ref": "MAL-02", "serial": 7, "set": "MAL"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}, "id": 13328, "maker": "t06", "status": "open", "thread": null, "to": null, "venue": "rastro", "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 7, "types": []}}, "venue": "rastro"}, "scope": "public", "t": 8.5833, "tick": 871, "type": "offer.listed"}
