{"actor": "t16", "id": 44564, "payload": {"offer": {"created_tick": 873, "expires_tick": 883, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 5, "types": []}, "id": 13351, "maker": "t16", "status": "open", "thread": null, "to": null, "venue": "rastro", "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:RET-02"]}}, "venue": "rastro"}, "scope": "public", "t": 8.6, "tick": 873, "type": "offer.listed"}
{"actor": "", "id": 44565, "payload": {"offer": 13341, "venue": "rastro"}, "scope": "public", "t": 8.6, "tick": 873, "type": "offer.cancelled"}
{"actor": "abuela", "id": 44566, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 8127, "offer": {"created_tick": 873, "expires_tick": 877, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 5, "types": []}, "id": 13346, "maker": "abuela", "status": "open", "thread": 1249, "to": "t04", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [{"id": 136, "kind": "card", "print_run": 300, "rarity": "common", "ref": "LAT-04", "serial": 4, "set": "LAT"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}}, "sender": "abuela", "team": "t04", "text": "¡Ay, Maruja, hija! Mi bolsillo también está flojito, ya sabes. Cinco te doy, y con cariño, que esa foto me trae a mi madre entera. Y un consejo, cariño: una página completa vale mucho más que las sueltas, ¡cambia tus repetidas! ¿Un cafetito mientras piensas?", "thread": 1249, "with": "abuela"}, "scope": "public", "t": 8.6, "tick": 873, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "t08", "id": 44569, "payload": {"offer": {"created_tick": 873, "expires_tick": 876, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [{"id": 115, "kind": "card", "print_run": 300, "rarity": "common", "ref": "LAV-04", "serial": 6, "set": "LAV"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}, "id": 13352, "maker": "t08", "status": "open", "thread": null, "to": null, "venue": "rastro", "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 8, "types": []}}, "venue": "rastro"}, "scope": "public", "t": 8.6, "tick": 873, "type": "offer.listed"}
{"actor": "abuela", "id": 44570, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 8125, "offer": {"created_tick": 873, "expires_tick": 877, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 5, "types": []}, "id": 13344, "maker": "abuela", "status": "open", "thread": 1240, "to": "t15", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [{"id": 218, "kind": "card", "print_run": 300, "rarity": "common", "ref": "SAL-04", "serial": 8, "set": "SAL"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}}, "sender": "abuela", "team": "t15", "text": "Ay, hijo, qué cabecita la tuya, no paras. But my box of repeats is already full, cariño. Look here instead: Café en Goya, 5 P, it is yours. And swap those duplicates with El Chato's customers, a full page is worth much more. ¿Has comido ya?", "thread": 1240, "with": "abuela"}, "scope": "public", "t": 8.6, "tick": 873, "type": "thread.message"}
