{"actor": "", "id": 44666, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "team": "t07", "thread": 1256, "topic": {"sell": {"assets": [825]}}, "with": "abuela"}, "scope": "public", "t": 8.625, "tick": 876, "type": "thread.opened"}
{"actor": "pilar", "id": 44667, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 8149, "offer": {"created_tick": 876, "expires_tick": 880, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 53, "types": []}, "id": 13379, "maker": "pilar", "status": "open", "thread": 1250, "to": "t05", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [{"id": 848, "kind": "card", "print_run": 30, "rarity": "rare", "ref": "MAL-09", "serial": 6, "set": "MAL"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}}, "sender": "pilar", "team": "t05", "text": "Sesenta y nueve? Señor mío, we are still in different centuries. I have followed you courteously: fifty-three pesetas. That is a gentleman's price for a Malasaña card, and my hand is extended.", "thread": 1250, "with": "pilar"}, "scope": "public", "t": 8.625, "tick": 876, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "picaros", "id": 44670, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 8151, "offer": {"created_tick": 876, "expires_tick": 880, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:LAT-09"]}, "id": 13381, "maker": "picaros", "status": "open", "thread": 1252, "to": "t08", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 67, "types": []}}, "sender": "picaros", "team": "t08", "text": "\"¡Cuarenta! Nando, hold me, I'm fainting—\" \"—he's fainting, amigo, catch him!\" Listen, the man in Toledo offered more and we said no, because his face was unlucky. Yours is lucky. Sixty-seven pesos, contante y sonante, and the train waits for nobody. ¿Sí? Say sí and it's yours.", "thread": 1252, "with": "picaros"}, "scope": "public", "t": 8.625, "tick": 876, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "picaros", "id": 44673, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 8153, "offer": {"created_tick": 876, "expires_tick": 880, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 4, "types": []}, "id": 13383, "maker": "picaros", "status": "open", "thread": 1255, "to": "t04", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [{"id": 953, "kind": "card", "print_run": 300, "rarity": "common", "ref": "LAT-04", "serial": 26, "set": "LAT"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}}, "sender": "picaros", "team": "t04", "text": "¡Buenos días, jefe! Paco y Nando, a su servicio. ¡La Terciana! Preciosa carta, la vimos en el Mercado de la Cebada el martes, misma pinta, misma esquina... y allí volaba por cuatro primas. Cuatro le damos, aquí, ahora, en mano. ¿Cerramos antes de que mi hermano se arrepienta?", "thread": 1255, "with": "picaros"}, "scope": "public", "t": 8.625, "tick": 876, "type": "thread.message"}
